<a name="about"></a>

<h2>About the Camp</h2>

<p>
The Health Checkup Camp is organized every year to spread awareness about
healthy living. People of all age groups can participate in the camp and
receive free health services.
</p>

<p>
The main goal of this camp is to detect health problems early and encourage
people to take better care of their health.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>Our Objectives</h2>

<ul>

<li>Provide free health checkups</li>

<li>Promote healthy lifestyle</li>

<li>Create health awareness</li>

<li>Offer free medical advice</li>

<li>Help people prevent diseases</li>

<li>Support the local community</li>

</ul>

